  "summary": {
    "zh": "中国多基地电池制造商。能源按品种披露（电力/天然气/煤炭/蒸汽），范围一含工艺与逸散排放，因此能源口径算出的范围一必然低于披露值——这正是审计对话的起点。",
    "en": "Multi-site Chinese battery manufacturer. Energy is disclosed by carrier (electricity / natural gas / coal / steam); Scope 1 also contains process and fugitive emissions, so an energy-only build necessarily lands below the disclosed Scope 1. That gap is the point."
  },
